title: 'statement gossip: remove unused code left by the v2 DHT work'
doc:
- audience: Node Dev
  description: |-
    Removes code in sc-network-statement that the v2 DHT work introduced and nothing uses anymore:
    orchestrator hooks that only logged, stale dead_code allows, and per-source reference counts in
    explicit affinity that never exceeded one. Behaviour does not change on either path.
crates:
- name: sc-network-statement
  bump: patch
